    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in an epic battle for equality throughout Argentine history!</strong></h2>&quot;Valerosa&quot; invites you to relive pivotal moments when the fight for women's rights took center stage, as you engage in intense debates and present arguments to shape the course of history.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560960/extras/c5c621921b9348d4fbcc1c5ab22e68b2.poster.avif?t=1715707357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560960/extras/c5c621921b9348d4fbcc1c5ab22e68b2.webm?t=1715707357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560960/extras/c5c621921b9348d4fbcc1c5ab22e68b2.mp4?t=1715707357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter historical figures as you explore diverse cultural contexts!</strong></h2>Travel through different eras, from the struggle for women's suffrage in 1947 to battles over divorce law in 1987 and the abortion debate in 2020. Uncover key events and meet the inspiring women who challenged the norms of their time.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560960/extras/92ed6b27a3bf2d886d2d3b28ccb0d8da.poster.avif?t=1715707357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560960/extras/92ed6b27a3bf2d886d2d3b28ccb0d8da.webm?t=1715707357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560960/extras/92ed6b27a3bf2d886d2d3b28ccb0d8da.mp4?t=1715707357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manifest the Power of Words!</strong></h2>Your arguments and choices will determine the outcome of each encounter and influence the fate of the women you meet along the way. The best responses will lead you to the approval of various laws.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560960/extras/d66ab566114a5e481534bb536dd15416.poster.avif?t=1715707357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560960/extras/d66ab566114a5e481534bb536dd15416.webm?t=1715707357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2560960/extras/d66ab566114a5e481534bb536dd15416.mp4?t=1715707357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the courageous women and challenge history to shape a better future!</strong></h2>Add &quot;Valerosa&quot; to your wishlist and get ready for an exhilarating and educational gaming experience like no other.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature list:</strong></h2>\u2022 Dialectical battles<br>\u2022 Turn-based strategy<br>\u2022 Dynamic choices<br>\u2022 Different dialogue combinations<br>\u2022 Empowered storytelling<br>\u2022 Multiple endings",
